{"title":"Mechaquartz Watches","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the CZARD mechaquartz watch collection, where modern precision meets the tactile character of traditional chronographs. The Compass series brings together Veni, Vidi and Vici-three 38mm timepieces shaped by balanced proportions, heritage-inspired details and a distinctive identity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach mecha quartz chronograph combines dependable quartz accuracy with mechanical chronograph action, producing fluid chronograph seconds, a crisp pusher response and an instant return to zero. High-domed crystals, applied indices and carefully considered dial colours give every model its own presence while preserving the collection’s shared character.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreated for collectors who appreciate classical chronograph design and effortless everyday usability, the CZARD Compass collection expresses precision through restraint. Explore Veni, Vidi and Vici, and choose the bearing that speaks to you.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"veni","title":"VENI","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe first bearing in the arc. Rose gold over a charcoal finished dial.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"CZARD","offers":[{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ none","offer_id":49008099786906,"sku":null,"price":14999.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ 499","offer_id":49011829768346,"sku":null,"price":15498.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ 999","offer_id":49011829801114,"sku":null,"price":15998.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ 1999","offer_id":49011829833882,"sku":null,"price":16998.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ 2499","offer_id":49011829866650,"sku":null,"price":17498.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"title":"One Year Warranty \/ 2999","offer_id":49011829899418,"sku":null,"price":17998.0,"currency_code":"INR","in_stock":true},{"t